# GMS's own shape: a share of the pool on a clock of its own, ending at 4% of
# it every 4 seconds. It rode the swing until the Priest's Holy Fountain built
# a clock to hang it on -- which paid a Crusader swinging at 0.6s more than
# three times what GMS pays them.
#
# The interval steps a clean quarter-second over the twenty levels, so it lands
# on GMS's 4 seconds exactly rather than near it.
name: "Self Recovery"
skill_order: 4
description: "Regularly recovers some HP, even in combat."
kind: SKILL_KIND_PASSIVE
job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_CRUSADER
max_level: 20
base {
  regen_pct: 0.021
  regen_interval_seconds: 8.75
}
per_level {
  regen_pct: 0.001
  regen_interval_seconds: -0.25
}
